{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01CA3BusZDuFsH9RTdVrgkPG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the codebase. Let me start implementing the changes in order.\n\n## E1: Fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell`\n\nI need to add this in `engine/casting.py`, right after the spell is pushed to the stack.\n\nLooking at the `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` fields:\n- `spell: Any = None`  \n- `player: Any = None`\n- `card: Any = None`\n- `controller: Any = None`\n\nI need to fire it after `game.stack.push(stack_obj)` with `spell=stack_obj`, `card=card`, `controller=player`.\nSince `game` is passed as a parameter to `cast_spell`, I can access the trigger manager and fire the event right after pushing to the stack.\n\n## E2: Add + fire `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`\n\nI need to define the event class in `engine/events.py` and then fire it in `GameState.advance_phase` when the phase transitions to `PRECOMBAT_MAIN`. Looking at the `advance_phase` method, I need to find where it sets the phase and step, then trigger the event at the right moment.\n\nThe key detail from the TODO is that the event should fire after `empty_mana_pools()` is called, so anything a handler adds to the mana pool survives into the main phase. This means the sequence is: set the new phase, empty the pools, then fire the event if we're entering `PRECOMBAT_MAIN`.\n\nAdding the event firing logic...\n\nNow for the battlefield cost-reduction aggregation in `get_cost_reduction`, I need to loop through permanents on the battlefield and check if they have a `spell_cost_reduction` method, then aggregate those reductions for instant and sorcery spells. Now let me look at the FDN 235 card to understand the trigger pattern I need to match.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7506,"cache_read_input_tokens":83929,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7506},"output_tokens":35,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ad560dd-f0de-48bf-a5ec-5012d23eae4b","uuid":"862252da-c240-4cdb-8506-a67673cd23fb","request_id":"req_011Cbw9YVMK7n7jhnFvWFo4Q"}
