{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_018rh9dqnrQUdcigWe6BJYQ2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The stack is empty after `declare_attackers`. That means the attack trigger was not fired or not pushed to the stack. Let me investigate further.\n\nLooking at `declare_attackers` in test_utils.py:\n```python\ndef declare_attackers(game, attacker_names):\n    if (game.phase, game.step) != (Phase.COMBAT, Step.DECLARE_ATTACKERS):\n        advance_to_phase(game, Phase.COMBAT, Step.DECLARE_ATTACKERS)\n    ...\n```\n\nSo it's setting the combat state and then calling the declare_attackers_step function from the engine.combat module to see what that actually does.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":124484,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1506},"output_tokens":28,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ad560dd-f0de-48bf-a5ec-5012d23eae4b","uuid":"d416477e-fc94-4354-8d90-2f1c5d60b82d","request_id":"req_011CbwA7xxQkWdiA7jU9vmsC"}
