{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01HFYyuRnEerAnyoU1FmNhVq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the target handling for loyalty abilities isn't in `_activate_loyalty_ability`. Targets are not explicitly handled through `chosen_targets` in the loyalty ability flow. Fdn_81 uses `getattr(pw, '_resolve_target', None)` which is set externally in tests.\n\nFor my tests, I'll follow the same pattern: set `pw._resolve_target = ...` for single targets, and `pw._resolve_targets = [...]` for multiple targets. Then in the effects, I'll read from both `chosen_targets` and fall back to `_resolve_target`/`_resolve_targets`.\nI'll stick with the fdn_81 approach of checking both `chosen_targets` and the `_resolve_target` fallback when reading targets.\n\nNow I'm planning out Ral Zarek's +1 ability: it lets you surveil 2, meaning you look at the top 2 cards of your library and choose which ones to send to the graveyard and which to keep on top. I'll implement this by iterating through each of the top 2 cards and asking whether to put it in the graveyard, then putting the kept cards back on top in the order they were examined.\n\nFor the −1 ability, I'm reading the list of target players and having each one discard a card of their choice. The −2 ability reanimates a target creature from the graveyard with mana value 3 or less by moving it from the graveyard to the battlefield. The −7 ability flips 5 coins against a target opponent and adds the number of heads to that player's skip turn counter.\n\nNow I need to update the engine to handle the skip_turns mechanic—I'll initialize it on the player object and then check during phase advancement whether the active player should skip their turn. I'm also looking at how the Planeswalker's loyalty abilities determine their targets.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":154077,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":515},"output_tokens":31,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ad560dd-f0de-48bf-a5ec-5012d23eae4b","uuid":"6fe519fa-fbe1-44b4-abe8-f70e63ba3f5c","request_id":"req_011CbwC9EX3jQr8oMVkmkiHd"}
