e per player","+Paradigm trigger is registered once via `controller._paradigm_capstone_registered`","+flag. Copies of the Capstone cast via Paradigm resolve normally but don't re-register","+(flag is already set). Copies also exile themselves via `_exile_instead_of_graveyard`.","+","+## sos_201 — Miracle first-draw tracking","+The miracle condition sets `player._last_miracle_draw_turn = game.turn_number` inside","+the condition function itself (before returning True). This ensures only the first","+draw triggers miracle — subsequent draws in the same turn see the flag already set.","+","+## sos_97 — skip_turns engine change","+Added skip_turns handling in `advance_phase` (game_state.py): when the next player","+has `skip_turns > 0`, decrement and give the turn to the other player instead.","+Deliberate limitation: only handles 2-player games; extra_turns queue is unaffected.","+","+## sos_97 — game.rng for coin flips","+Coin flips use `getattr(game, \"rng\", None)` with fallback to `random.Random()`.","+Tests set `game.rng` to a seeded or monkeypatched RNG for determinism."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
